  "project_workers": {
    "since": "3.21.0",
    "capability": "agents.projectWorkers",
    "note": "A project's conversation owner has exactly one pinned coordinator, which only the bridge makes and only project deletion retires, and any number of workers below it. Without include_project_workers a project owner lists its pinned coordinator alone, the projection every roster read that predates workers carries (board rows, project conversations, agent.remove); every other owner lists all of its agents either way. pinned_agent_id is present only on a project owner.",
